OL,3,GNEWSALeaky tank causes major flooding
OL,4,Aat primary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA head teacher has said staff are
OL,7,Fworking hard to fully reopen a primary
OL,8,Fschool that had to close after a leak
OL,9,Fcaused extensive flooding.
OL,11,FStudents at d'Auvergne School in Jersey
OL,12,Fwere told not to attend after the leak
OL,13,Fin a hot water tank flooded the first
OL,14,Ffloor overnight.
OL,16,FHead teacher Sam Cooper said there was
OL,17,Fabout 3in (8cm) deep water in some
OL,18,Fcorridors and parts "felt like a
OL,19,Fswimming pool".
